OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to restore weathervane shot
OL,4,Aoff in prank                           
OL,6,FMore than #18,000 has been raised to   
OL,7,Frepair a village church spire and put  
OL,8,Fback its original weathervane, which   
OL,9,Fwas shot off in a "cider-fuelled prank"
OL,10,Fmore than 50 years ago.                
OL,12,FIn 1972, a group of boys targeted All  
OL,13,FSaints Church, Kingweston, Somerset;   
OL,14,Ftwo of them, now in their 70s, have    
OL,15,Fsince confessed and contributed to the 
OL,16,Ffundraiser.                            
OL,18,FLast year, the weathervane was found in
OL,19,Fa shed, just as a report recommended   
OL,20,Furgent repairs to the spire costing    
OL,21,F#120,000.                              
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
