OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal to restore weathervane shot
OL,4,Aoff in prank                           
OL,6,F"It still has two bullet holes in it,  
OL,7,Fand it's awaiting restoration,"        
OL,8,Fresident Jane Sedgman said. "But it's  
OL,9,Fextraordinary that it appeared from    
OL,10,Fnowhere, just at this point when we're 
OL,11,Fgoing to have to scaffold the spire to 
OL,12,Frepair it."                            
